🛠 Requirements (Kali Linux)

Kali Linux (latest recommended)

Python 3.10 or higher

Nmap installed

Python libraries:

pyfiglet

python-nmap

Root privileges (required for scanning)

📦 Install Commands
sudo apt update
sudo apt install python3 python3-pip nmap -y
pip install pyfiglet python-nmap


⚠️ Use only on networks you own or have permission to scan.
